@startuml hmi-agent-authoring
!theme plain
title HMI agent authoring - shared editor services
actor "Customer's existing agent" as customer
component "VS Code language-model tool API\nagent/tools.ts" as vscode
component "Stdio MCP proxy\nagent/mcpClient.ts" as proxy
component "Explicit workspace connection\nagent/connect.ts + bridge.ts\nprivate loopback capability" as mcp
component "Common request boundary\nagent/boundary.ts" as boundary
component "Read-only context and inspection\nagent/queries.ts" as queries
component "Authoring operations\nagent/service.ts + geometryQuality.ts" as service
component "Editor-authoritative snapshots\nagent/documents.ts" as documents
component "Persistent revisioned drafts\nagent/drafts.ts\nmutation lock and replay receipts" as drafts
component "Composition and semantic edits\nagent/compose.ts + layout.ts + edits.ts" as edits
component "Versioned composition references\nagent/patterns.ts + patternReferences.ts\nexplicit synthetic example topology" as patterns
component "Project image snapshots\nagent/assets.ts + assetRasterizer.ts\ncontent hashes and static decoded pixels" as assets
component "Existing native parser, compiler\nHMI binding and catalogue services" as native
component "Shared drawing and isolated rasterizer\nagent/render.ts + library.ts\nproject symbols and bundled fonts" as drawing
component "HMI Builder proposal mode\neditor/proposals.ts + ProposalReview.tsx\nread-only virtual document and synthetic comparison" as proposal
component "Single editor WorkspaceEdit\nagent/apply.ts\nexplicit save outcome" as apply
component "Operation lifetime\nagent/lifetime.ts\nbounded native reads and cancellation" as lifetime
component "Revision and image manifests\nagent/artifacts.ts + visualReview.ts" as evidence
component "Synthetic exploration\nagent/exploration.ts + Exploration.tsx\nshared runtime display, no network or commands" as explore
component "Configured Control Studio handoff\neditor/controlStudioHandoff.ts" as studio
component "Named local simulator sessions\nagent/simulator.ts\nexplicit login, matching deployed page" as simulator
component "Remote samples and named owner sessions\nhmi/remote_values + remote_operations" as remote
component "Authenticated TLS mesh\nmesh/hmi_reads + hmi_operations" as mesh
component "Owning Hmi.Display task\nnative policy, typed write, pulse end and audit" as owner
component "Bounded ordinary value-card painting\ndisplay/valuePaintQueue.ts\nwhole-card coalescing, urgent states immediate" as paint
explore --> paint : shared display lifecycle
customer --> vscode : native tools
customer --> proxy : stdio tools and PNGs
proxy --> mcp : private authenticated JSON-RPC
mcp --> vscode : same tool implementation
vscode --> lifetime : request budget / cancellation
lifetime --> native : cancel read-only requests
vscode --> boundary : window-owned workspace identity
boundary --> queries : read operations
boundary --> service : draft operations
queries --> remote : selected serving runtime publish catalogue
service --> simulator : explicit bounded simulator journey
simulator --> owner : existing named HMI session and command API
remote --> mesh : bounded non-realtime reads / authenticated operations
mesh --> owner : own named login and policy
note right of mesh
Discovery requests already-live peers
and excludes the local runtime.
end note
queries --> documents : dirty text before disk
queries --> native : existing owners
queries --> patterns : discover definitions / example model
patterns --> drawing : shared drawing via library.ts
service --> queries : current context and revisions
service --> drafts : revision check / isolated proposal
service --> edits : deterministic model changes
service --> native : canonical format and validation
service --> drawing : synthetic design frame / PNG
service --> assets : referenced images / reviewed hash comparison
assets --> documents : dirty SVG text
assets --> native : existing bounded HMI bundle reader
assets --> drawing : embedded static image resources
service --> evidence : revision-bound findings and image identities
service --> explore : explicit snapshot exploration
proposal --> explore : navigate / popup / read-only controls
proposal --> studio : source editor only, configured equipment loop
service --> proposal : exact-revision before/after and object diff
proposal --> service : explicit Apply / Discard with fresh request context
service --> apply : reviewed revision, explicit incomplete marker when requested
apply --> documents : compare all base revisions
apply --> service : committed result for durable receipt
note bottom of service
No model provider or implicit deployment / physical-operation authority.
Simulator operation requires an explicitly connected local named session.
Program fingerprint changes block application.
Post-commit cancellation retains the committed outcome.
Proposal mode exposes no deployment or runtime operations.
Incomplete pages are refused by native bundle deployment checks.
Source outcome uncertainty retains the prepared application receipt.
end note
@enduml
